# THE BUILD CONTEXT IS UPLOADED TO CLOUD BUILD. Everything listed here would otherwise be
# sent over the network on every deploy, and `outputs/` alone is 1.5 GB of checkpoints that
# the image downloads from the Hub anyway. A context that large turns a two-minute deploy
# into a twenty-minute one and can exhaust the build machine's disk.
.git
.venv
venv
outputs
data
demo
notebooks
benchmarks
kernels
orchestration
infra
forge_src.tgz
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.DS_Store
.claude
